  "body": "I'm a simple user there...\n\n1 - Go to a website \n2 - Click a \"Connect Device\" button\n3 - Pick a nearby Bluetooth device\n4 - Interact with the device thanks to the website\n5 - Close the tab\n\nI expect now the device to not be connected to the website anymore as my camera would not be used anymore by a video-chat website for instance.\n",
